  DNA v63 PRE-FLIGHT -- would a BURST-weighted centroid differentiate
  the group further than a RATE-weighted one? Computed from the burst
  profile as measured; no readout is built to ask this.
    arm           rate centroid  burst centroid burst Hz     creatures
    burst         0.4074 +/- 0.0099 0.6228 +/- 0.0113 0.4428 +/- 0.0344 12
